  DisplayName: Ability Boosts
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/classes/ability-boosts.webp
  Description: At 5th level and every 5 levels thereafter, boost four different ability
    scores. You can use these boosts to increase ability scores above 18. Boosting
    an ability score increases it by 1 if it's already 18 or above, or by 2 if it
    starts out below 18. Your eidolon also gets four ability boosts at these levels.
    The eidolon's ability boosts follow the same rules as yours.
